Third-Party Components and Assets
==================================

The MIT license above applies only to the original ego2dex source code
identified by its copyright notices. This repository does not grant rights to
third-party libraries, model implementations, model weights, datasets, MANO
assets, robot descriptions, or generated data.

ego2dex is an orchestration pipeline and does not relicense the third-party
components that users may install or invoke. Each component remains subject to
its own license and terms. Several optional components or assets may be
non-commercial, research-only, copyleft, gated, or subject to additional
attribution requirements. Users are responsible for reviewing and complying
with all applicable terms before use, redistribution, or commercial deployment.

The MANO hand model is gated and licensed for non-commercial scientific
research. ego2dex does not vendor MANO files. Users must obtain
MANO_RIGHT.pkl and MANO_LEFT.pkl directly from the MANO website and comply
with its license.

Model weights and other downloaded assets are intentionally excluded from this
repository. See docs/licenses.md, docs/install.md, and infra/README.md for the
component matrix and external-infrastructure policy.

